<LANGUAGE>
    <CATEGORY Name="Voices_01_01_upsilon_awake">
        <Entry Name="general_1a_wakeup_001_player_001">What happened?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_1a_stumblingindark_001_player_001">Hello? Mr Munshi?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_1a_stumblingindark_002_player_001">Did something go wrong?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_1a_stumblingindark_003_player_001">This isn&apos;t funny.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_1a_stumblingindark_004_player_001">I&apos;m not supposed to put myself in -</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_1a_stumblingindark_005_player_001">- this is kind of stressing me out.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_1a_stumblingindark_006_player_001">Hey?! Anyone?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="General_1B_PowerOn_BeforeCollapse_001_Player_001">What the hell is this place? How did I get here?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="General_1B_PowerOn_StandUp_001_Player_001">I can figure this out. I just need to stay calm. No need to make things worse.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2b_datamineairlockintercom_001_amy_001">Carl, it&apos;s working better than expected. They&apos;re having a really hard time getting the doors open.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2b_datamineairlockintercom_002_carl_001">Well, perma-seal as many as you can. Rather not take any chances.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2b_datamineairlockintercom_003_amy_001">Roger. Did you cut off the factory floor?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2b_datamineairlockintercom_004_carl_001">All done. Should keep most of them out. I&apos;m on my way to lock off the comm center.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2b_datamineairlockintercom_005_amy_001">Just make sure to leave a way out of here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2b_datamineairlockintercom_006_carl_001">Trust me, I&apos;ll get you to Theta safe and sound. We just need to make sure we leave enough power running so we don&apos;t have to return.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2b_datamineairlockintercom_007_amy_001">I hear that. See you back at camp.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_001_semiinfectedrobot_001">* Uncomfortable breathing *</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_002_amy_001">Hey, you. Can you talk? Can you talk like the others?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_003_semiinfectedrobot_001">* Uncomfortable breathing *</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_004_amy_001">Why are you like this?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_005_semiinfectedrobot_001">* Uncomfortable breathing *</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_006_amy_001">You want some structure gel? Yeah, you do. So weird. Doesn&apos;t make much sense.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_007_semiinfectedrobot_001">* Uncomfortable breathing *</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2c_dataminesemiinfectedrobot_008_amy_001">I&apos;m going to shut you down now, okay? Yeah, you&apos;re creepy as hell, so I&apos;m going to shut you...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_001_SuitRobot_001">Keep them closed, keep them out.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_002_SuitRobot_001">I don&apos;t recognize this place. Looks like Pathos-2, but nowhere I&apos;ve been before.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_003_SuitRobot_001">Say something, Vanessa. Did you close the doors? We should keep them closed.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_004_SuitRobot_001">It&apos;s all getting blurry now. I guess it&apos;s some kind of a seizure. I haven&apos;t felt this before.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_005_SuitRobot_001">I see something, something different now. It&apos;s not Lambda, that&apos;s for sure.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_006_SuitRobot_001">I don&apos;t recognize this place. Are we still on Pathos-2?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_007_SuitRobot_001">Take me back to Lambda. Let&apos;s get on the Curie and just forget about all this.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_008_SuitRobot_001">The black seeping sewage of the WAU. It&apos;s what they want.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_009_SuitRobot_001">Close it, close them all. The doors are on our side.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotRambling_010_SuitRobot_001">Is this Upsilon? That would make some sense.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_2i_suitrobotcallsout_005_suitrobot_001">*Don&apos;t go!*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SimonConfrontSuitRobot_001_Player_001">What&apos;s with you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotScaredOfEnemy_001_SuitRobot_001">God! It&apos;s coming for us. I don&apos;t want to be here. Please. Vanessa. No, don&apos;t think about Vanessa. It will get her too.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_SuitRobotScaredOfEnemy_002_SuitRobot_001">Go away! I haven&apos;t done anything to you. It&apos;s not my fault this happened. It&apos;s WAU. Blame the WAU.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2J_SuitRobotDies_001_SuitRobot_001">No! It&apos;s not fair! I survived! Aargh, no god -- !</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2J_SuitRobotDatamine_001_SuitRobot_001">No! It&apos;s not fair! I survived! Aargh!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2J_SuitRobotDatamine_002_SuitRobot_001">* sounds of the suit robot being ripped to shreds *</Entry>
        <Entry Name="General_2K_OmniToolNotConfigured_001_AutomatedVoice_001">Access denied - Incorrect format.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="General_2M_OmniToolFixed_001_AutomatedVoice_001">Access Granted.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2J_SuitRobotDrained_001_SuitRobot_001">No, nooo! Please... I want to live.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2J_SuitRobotDatamineDrained_001_SuitRobot_001">No, nooo! Please... I wanna live.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2J_SuitRobotDatamineDrained_002_SuitRobot_001">* Sound of Simon engaging with the wau flower while suit robot exhales and dies *</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_001_carl_001">Amy, are you there?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_002_amy_001">I&apos;m here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_003_carl_001">Ready to let it go yet?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_004_amy_001">I guess so.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_005_carl_001">Plenty of opportunity to go zen on the fishes back at Theta.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_006_amy_001">I&apos;m going to miss this place.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_007_carl_001">Upsilon?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_008_amy_001">Come on, we&apos;ve worked here for years. You&apos;re not even going to miss it a little bit?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_009_carl_001">A power plant full of psychotic machines? I&apos;ll find a way to cope.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_010_amy_001">That&apos;s cold, man. It&apos;s not Upsilon&apos;s fault it got swarmed.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_011_carl_001">Whatever, seal that thing and get back to camp already.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3b_datamineamyintercom_012_amy_001">Roger that.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoor_001_TalkingDoor_001">*What happened? I don&apos;t understand.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoor_002_TalkingDoor_001">*Can you help?*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoor_003_TalkingDoor_001">*Don&apos;t know what happened.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoor_004_TalkingDoor_001">*I need to get back.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoor_005_TalkingDoor_001">*Help, please.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorCloses_001_TalkingDoor_001">*Help me!*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorWeeps_001_TalkingDoor_001">*You should stay.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorWeeps_002_TalkingDoor_001">*It&apos;ll be all right.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorWeeps_003_TalkingDoor_001">*You instead of me.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorWeeps_004_TalkingDoor_001">*Everything&apos;s right.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorWeeps_005_TalkingDoor_001">*Stay here.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorWeeps_006_TalkingDoor_001">*Instead of me.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorWeeps_007_TalkingDoor_001">*It&apos;s all right.*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3G_TalkingDoorButton_001_TalkingDoor_001">*Get away from me!*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3G_TalkingDoorButton_002_TalkingDoor_001">*Leave me alone!*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3G_TalkingDoorButton_003_TalkingDoor_001">*Stop it!*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_InteractAfterDoorBang_001_Player_001">What is that - what&apos;s happening?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2I_InteractAfterDoorBang_002_SuitRobot_001">Keep the door closed.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_2J_SuitRobotSeeCorpse_001_Player_001">Christ! I didn&apos;t mean for that to happen. </Entry>
        <Entry Name="datamine_3a_entertunnel_001_player_001">What...  where am I?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3C_ReadAmyNotes_001_Player_001">Can&apos;t make any sense of it. Who are these people?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_1_001_Strohmeier_001">I know they told you that Field Technicians would get full access throughout Pathos-2. I&apos;m here to tell you, that&apos;s not going to happen.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_1_002_Strohmeier_001">Don&apos;t get me wrong. I don&apos;t want to get in your way, we need you guys to keep this place up and running, but there needs to be at least some level of security on these things.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_2_001_Strohmeier_001">I don&apos;t want to hear you barged into some quarantined area at Omicron and just knocked out the whole place with some virus or whatever the hell they are doing over there.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_3_001_Strohmeier_001">This is what you can do. You&apos;ll be able to use it to open doors - basically all of them. If you can&apos;t, there&apos;s something wrong or someone didn&apos;t want you in there. Then what do you do? </Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_4_001_Strohmeier_001">You shove that omnitool into a terminal and see if you can&apos;t get around it somehow. I mean sometimes you&apos;ll need to get into places where you don&apos;t belong.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_4_002_Strohmeier_001">Just find a way, you&apos;re an engineer for crying out loud.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_5_001_Strohmeier_001">What else? Take care of your gear. Don&apos;t be an asshole. That&apos;s about it really. My name is John Strohmeier, Pathos-2 security operative.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_OrientationVideo_5_002_Strohmeier_001">I got an office at Theta. Come see me if you got any issues you can&apos;t handle yourself. Good luck.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="Datamine_3F_TalkingDoorDrains_001_TalkingDoor_001">*No, stop, stop!*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_pickingupomnitool_001_player_001">I&apos;ll just hang on to this one. Got a feeling it&apos;s going to be useful.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="General_ReactingToOmnitool_001_Player_001">What&apos;s it doing? Picking up something close by?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="general_omnitoolopensdoor_001_player_001">It&apos;s a door opener. Of course.</Entry>
